.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RULE PREVIEW"
.SH NAME
hamstik rule preview \- Preview a rule without executing its actions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik rule preview [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Preview a rule without executing its actions
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RULE_ID
Automation rule id
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body-file
Read the JSON request body from this file; `-` reads stdin
.TP
.B --field
Structured JSON field as `key=value`; repeatable
